  "content": "\n\n<p>本模组为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>JEI</strong></a> 添加了新功能。该新功能允许玩家查看每种村民职业所需的工作台。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>使用方法：在绿宝石或村民刷怪蛋上按下 JEI 的“用途”键（默认：U），即可显示所有村民职业的列表。若想知道某个职业来自哪个模组，可按住 Shift 键，职业名称前将显示对应的模组 ID。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如果您正在寻找 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>REI</strong> </a>的对应版本，请查看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-professions-rep\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roughly Enough Professions (REP)</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KFppoR.png\" alt=\"Akliz 合作伙伴\" width=\"320\" height=\"152\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fakliz.net%252fmrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要服务器？使用优惠码 \"mrbysco\" 首月立减 20%</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如有任何问题，欢迎加入我的 Discord。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maPeNBK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/611982123435556884/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Discord 链接\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;<strong>想要支持我们吗？</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -Mrbysco</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shynieke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -ShyNieke</p>",
